{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally in Russia", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Mother Russia", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Famous Structures > The Kremlin", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The Order of Adjectives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you use two or more adjectives, the order of the adjectives is important.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "She wore an expensive red cotton dress to the party. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The ballerina wore a soft pink silk costume.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The following is the order of adjectives you need to keep in mind when describing something or someone:  <br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">general opinion</span>, <span class=\"strong\">specific opinion</span>, <span class=\"strong\">size</span>, <span class=\"strong\">shape</span>, <span class=\"strong\">age</span>, <span class=\"strong\">color</span>, <span class=\"strong\">nationality</span>, <span class=\"strong\">material</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Adjective order </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Example </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"opinion \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tattered \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shape \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"square \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"age \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"old \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"color \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"brown \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nationality \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Chinese \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"material\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lacquer\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span> Reacting to and Commenting on Stories ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you react to a story, you should let the storyteller know that you are interested.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>: The bride ran out of the church and left the groom at the altar!<br /><span class =\"strong\">Tom</span>: I don't believe it!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When you react, you can say things like:<br /> <br /> Really?<br />  She did?<br />  You're kidding!<br /> Amazing!<br /> Unbelievable!<br /> I don't believe it!<br /> No!", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "grand", "type": "name"}, {"content": "attractive in style and appearance  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Bolshoi Theater is a grand old building. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear at the ballet.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "column ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tall support for a building   ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Bolshoi Theater has a row of columns in front. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "ballerina ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a woman who dances in the ballet  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The ballerina danced in Swan Lake. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "balcony ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area of seats in the upper level of a theater  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She stood in the balcony and watched the dancers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "posture ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way you hold your body  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Ballerinas have very good posture.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "slipper ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a thin indoor shoe ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He gave her pink ballet slippers to wear. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rehearsal ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a time to practice ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The rehearsal for the ballet lasted several hours. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to rehearse ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to practice again and again ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dancers rehearse for many hours a day.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn5le02ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write 7 - 9 sentences about something you are interested in and you want to get better at, like a sport, dance or musical instrument.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say if it is difficult to learn.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain how you do it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say how often you practice doing it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your sentences to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write 40 to 50 words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about something I practice doing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Are you interested in the Bolshoi Theater?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, it's a grand old building! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: My grandmother came here every day. Come and look inside!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Really?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: My grandmother watched rehearsals. She practiced in the balcony. No one noticed a small quiet girl.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Uh huh."}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "18500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: One day the beautiful prima ballerina, Natalia Dudiniska, called her to the stage.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You're kidding!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: She watched my grandmother dance. She checked her feet and posture.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: She did!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Then she took grandmother to the ballet master. He gave her small pink leather slippers. She began rehearsing the next day.<br />"}, {"image": "engenn5le02ob03re2img03.jpg", "time": "40500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Amazing! <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Here is a photo of my grandmother, Olga Petrova, dancing in Swan Lake!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Unbelievable!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Come to the theater tonight. Watch my daughter dance.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd love to!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le02ob03re2img08.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn5le02ob03re5aud01", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "picture"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about things to do or take on a trip. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can react to and comment on stories and anecdotes.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can describe objects with words.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you go to the ballet?  ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you enjoy watching dance? What kind? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you enjoy dancing?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"conte